# November 21, 2026: Chemung County, New York (Elmira, Horseheads, Wellsburg, Lowman, Big Flats, Pine City), with three
# places just north in Schuyler County (Montour Falls and Watkins Glen). Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny
# (region wny, which offered Elmira, Fredonia and Montour Falls); the Atlas had nothing within 20 km of Elmira or within
# 15 km of Montour Falls.
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py, including the Chemung and Schuyler County
# Register lists), HMdb marker pages and nearby lists, parks.ny.gov (Newtown Battlefield), cem.va.gov (Woodlawn National
# Cemetery), arnotartmuseum.org, soaringmuseum.org, schuylerhistory.org, elmiraprisoncamp.com, johnwjonesmuseum.org,
# marktwainstudies.com (read through the web fetch tool), a Yahoo News (Star-Gazette) story on the prison camp's welcome
# centre, and a visitor's write-up of the prison camp (thereconstructionera.com). Every Register form tried for these
# two counties is an NPGallery placeholder. chemungvalleymuseum.org and msaviour.org answer 403 and their archived copies
# could not be opened, so the Chemung Valley History Museum's and Mount Saviour's hours are not checked.
from data_b import N
from data_ma import W
def L(t,u): return [t,u]
def HM(m,t): return ['HMdb: '+t,'https://www.hmdb.org/m.asp?m='+m]
NRC=W('National Register of Historic Places listings in Chemung County, New York')
NRS=W('National Register of Historic Places listings in Schuyler County, New York')

